      "id": "demo-table",
      "content": "## Reading corner · material notes\nA small desk, warm light, and somewhere to leave a book open.\n\n| Detail | Choice | Reason |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Shelf | Solid oak | Ages well |\n| Lamp | Warm white | Softer in the evening |\n| Chair | Woven seat | Light enough to move |\n\n==Keep the first version simple.== #work/notebook",
      "createdAt": "2026-09-09T07:20:00.000Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-09T07:20:00.000Z",
      "pinnedAt": null,
      "deletedAt": null,
      "images": []
    },
    {
      "id": "demo-math",
      "content": "### A page at a time\nTwenty minutes of reading a day adds up.\n\n$$20 \\times 365 = 7{,}300\\text{ minutes} \\approx 122\\text{ hours}$$\n\n- Keep a pencil in the book.\n- Write **one sentence** worth returning to.\n- Revisit it on Sunday.\n\n#learning/reading #work/notebook",
      "createdAt": "2026-09-09T06:10:00.000Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-09T06:10:00.000Z",
      "pinnedAt": null,
      "deletedAt": null,
